{
  "name": "Kualat: Shorten new RSS posts and tweet them",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shorten new RSS posts and tweet them\n\nPolls an RSS feed, creates a kua.lat short link for every new post, then posts the title with the short link to X (Twitter).\n\nGreat for blogs, podcasts or changelogs: publish once, share everywhere with a trackable link.\n\n**Set up:**\n1. Install the **@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat** community node under Settings → Community Nodes.\n2. Create a **Kualat API** credential (API URL, for example `https://kua.lat/api`, and an API key).\n3. Set your feed URL on the **RSS Feed Trigger** node.\n4. Connect an X (Twitter) OAuth2 credential on the **Post Tweet** node.\n5. Activate the workflow.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "i9000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "feedUrl": "https://example.com/feed.xml"
      },
      "id": "i9000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "RSS Feed Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "link",
        "operation": "create",
        "url": "={{ $json.link }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "description": "={{ $json.title }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "i9000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Create Link",
      "type": "@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat.kualat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "tweet",
        "operation": "create",
        "text": "=📰 {{ $('RSS Feed Trigger').item.json.title }}\n\n{{ $json.short_url }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "i9000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Post Tweet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twitter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [520, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "RSS Feed Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Tweet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
